    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Mathematics Association of Pakistan (MAP) recently held its first workshop for teachers covering the O'Level Mathematics syllabus at The Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development. Held at the request of educators, thirty-two teachers from government and private schools in Karachi attended the four-day workshop.",
